<title>UK: JDB prices $500 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>JDB prices $500 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by joint lead managers Goldman Sachs and SBC Warburg, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   JAPAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  JAPAN</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	COUPON     7.0	 MATURITY    02.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.378   PAY DATE    02.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.753    SPREAD	+9 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
